## Dataset

This project uses the Sample Superstore dataset for sales and business performance analysis.

The data includes:
- Orders: Sales, profit, customer, product, and shipping details.
- People: Regional manager information.
- Returns: Returned order information.

The dataset was used for data cleaning, data modelling, DAX calculations, and dashboard development.

## Dataset Source

The project uses the Sample Superstore dataset provided by Tableau.

